013700                      CLR-ERROR-BLOCK
013800     IF ERR-SQLCODE NOT = ZERO
013900        MOVE 'CALL CLRCM040' TO ERR-PARA
014000        GO TO 9000-RETURN
014100     END-IF
014200     MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(PARM-PARAM-VALUE) TO WS-LLNT-GBP
014300     .
014400 1300-GET-PARAMETERS-EXIT.
014500     EXIT.
